{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "设备与流程",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 106.74,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "防御不能指望员工永远不被骗，要让一个人被骗，也不够造成损失。",
   "spoken": "防御不能指望员工永远不被骗，要让一个人被骗，也不够造成损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 7.037
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "第一条，设备分离。",
   "spoken": "第一条，设备分离。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 7.5,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 7.602,
   "speechEnd": 9.141
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "签名专用设备，只用来签名和独立解码，不收邮件，不上 Telegram，不打开外部文件。",
   "spoken": "签名专用设备，只用来签名和独立解码，不收邮件，不上 Telegram，不打开外部文件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 9.56,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 9.56,
   "speechEnd": 16.626
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "日常办公电脑，用来沟通和写文档，不存生产凭证和私钥。",
   "spoken": "日常办公电脑，用来沟通和写文档，不存生产凭证和私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 17.06,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 17.155,
   "speechEnd": 22.411
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "开发电脑要运行外部项目，就放进隔离的虚拟机，或者一次性环境。",
   "spoken": "开发电脑要运行外部项目，就放进隔离的虚拟机，或者一次性环境。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 22.8,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 22.898,
   "speechEnd": 29.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "第二条，流程控制。",
   "spoken": "第二条，流程控制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 29.42,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 29.515,
   "speechEnd": 31.163
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "资金操作、合约发布、权限变更，至少两人独立确认，这叫双人原则。",
   "spoken": "资金操作、合约发布、权限变更，至少两人独立确认，这叫双人原则。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 31.64,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 31.64,
   "speechEnd": 37.746
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "大额交易和权限变更，用预先登记的电话或当面确认，这叫带外确认。",
   "spoken": "大额交易和权限变更，用预先登记的电话或当面确认，这叫带外确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 38.18,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 38.276,
   "speechEnd": 44.144
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "要点是，不用发起请求的那个渠道。",
   "spoken": "要点是，不用发起请求的那个渠道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 44.56,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 44.652,
   "speechEnd": 47.525
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "发起人、审批人、执行人、审计人，不能是同一个人，这叫职责分离。",
   "spoken": "发起人、审批人、执行人、审计人，不能是同一个人，这叫职责分离。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 47.98,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 47.98,
   "speechEnd": 54.68
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "关键系统用硬件密钥，会话短期有效，异地登录要告警。",
   "spoken": "关键系统用硬件密钥，会话短期有效，异地登录要告警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 55.08,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 55.174,
   "speechEnd": 60.062
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "第三条，管好人员的进出。",
   "spoken": "第三条，管好人员的进出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 60.5,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 60.5,
   "speechEnd": 62.653
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "招聘时，视频面试本人出镜，核验证件和履历，远程岗位核验设备所在地。",
   "spoken": "招聘时，视频面试本人出镜，核验证件和履历，远程岗位核验设备所在地。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 63.04,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 63.04,
   "speechEnd": 69.639
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "离职当天，回收全部权限。",
   "spoken": "离职当天，回收全部权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 70.06,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 70.151,
   "speechEnd": 71.961
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "不只是代码仓库和云，还有 npm、域名注册商、官方社交账号、多签签名人身份。",
   "spoken": "不只是代码仓库和云，还有 npm、域名注册商、官方社交账号、多签签名人身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 72.44,
   "dur": 7.52,
   "speechStart": 72.536,
   "speechEnd": 79.774
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "漏掉一个边缘权限，前员工的账号，就是一扇没锁的门。",
   "spoken": "漏掉一个边缘权限，前员工的账号，就是一扇没锁的门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 80.18,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 80.18,
   "speechEnd": 85.182
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "第四条，留意内部人风险的早期信号。",
   "spoken": "第四条，留意内部人风险的早期信号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 85.6,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 85.6,
   "speechEnd": 89.131
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "访问和岗位无关的数据，短时间大量导出，借口紧急，要求绕过审批。",
   "spoken": "访问和岗位无关的数据，短时间大量导出，借口紧急，要求绕过审批。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 89.58,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 89.58,
   "speechEnd": 94.858
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "还有坚持独自处理某类操作，拒绝休假或轮岗。",
   "spoken": "还有坚持独自楚理某类操作，拒绝休架或轮岗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 95.32,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 95.32,
   "speechEnd": 99.937
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "最后，要有匿名报告渠道，员工报告可疑接触，不受惩罚。",
   "spoken": "最后，要有匿名报告渠道，员工报告可疑接触，不受惩罚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
